    "For the inventory balance, when you say orders are fulfilled using \"available inventory from the previous month, current in-house production, and outsourced units,\" does this mean that in any given month, the total units available to meet demand (current + backorders) equal: beginning inventory + in-house production + outsourcing, and any shortfall becomes a backorder carried to the next month?"
